## Operator Decision Menu

Choose one. Do not approve raw code without reviewed evidence.

| Choice | Meaning |
|---|---|
| accept reviewed result | Review passed, verify passed, and rollback is known |
| ask for repair | One narrow issue remains and a bounded follow-up is safe |
| escalate to investigator | Root cause is unclear or repeated failure needs higher-tier analysis |
| choose tie-breaker option | Worker and investigator disagree after repeated cycles |
| rollback | Restore last known-good state |
| stop | Halt until the open question is answered |

